OL,3,GNEWSAPolice stop man in park for using
OL,4,Aimitation swords
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man was given "strong words" by
OL,7,Fofficers after using imitation swords
OL,8,Fto practise martial arts in a busy
OL,9,Fpark.
OL,11,FCambridgeshire Police, with help from
OL,12,Fpolice dog Ghost, said they stopped the
OL,13,Fman from training with the imitation
OL,14,Fswords on Sunday in Central Park,
OL,15,FPeterborough, after he was reported by
OL,16,Fa member of the public.
OL,18,FThe force said on social media: "Our
OL,19,Fcrime-fighting canine and his handler
OL,20,Fattended, and the man was horrified to
OL,21,Frealise that using imitation swords in
OL,22,Fpublic was an offence.
OL,23,APub: 20-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
